This document provides comprehensive methodological details for the Mendelian randomization analysis investigating causal relationships between genetic liability to endometriosis and pregnancy outcomes. All analyses were conducted following established guidelines for MR studies and employed multiple sensitivity analyses to assess the robustness of findings.

For questions regarding methodology or data access, please contact the corresponding author.